  "The translations of this site were made by machine and haven't been reviewed by people yet. If something reads wrong in your language, please help fix it: find the text, write how it should read, and we'll do the rest.": {
    "model": "translategemma-27b",
    "msgstr": "本网站上的翻译是由机器完成的，尚未经过人工校对。如果您发现有任何地方的翻译不准确或不自然，请帮助我们改进：找到相关文本，写出您认为正确的译文，其余的修改工作由我们来完成。"
  },
  "There are no accounts, profiles, contacts, followers, feeds, streaks, scores, or permanent social graph. randos is closer to conversational infrastructure than social media.": {
    "model": "translategemma-12b",
    "msgstr": "randos 平台不提供账户、个人资料、联系方式、关注者、动态、连续使用记录、评分等功能，也不存在永久性的社交关系图谱。randos 更接近于一种对话基础设施，而非传统的社交媒体。"
  },
  "This site's translations were made by machine. If something reads wrong, find it below and press “Suggest a fix”: it opens an issue on GitHub with everything filled in but your fix (you need a GitHub account). A pull request with your fix opens on its own, and it goes live once it's reviewed.": {
    "model": "translategemma-12b",
    "msgstr": "本网站的翻译是由机器自动生成的。如果发现翻译有误，请在下方找到相关内容，点击“建议修改”。这将会在GitHub上创建一个问题，其中所有信息都已填写完毕，只需您提供修改建议即可（您需要一个GitHub账号）。您的修改建议会自动生成一个“拉取请求”，一旦审核通过，修改内容将立即生效。"
  },
